"No com.apple.security.network.client — Talkie cannot be granted network access." = "没有 com.apple.security.network.client——无法授予 Talkie 网络访问权限。";
"Verify it yourself" = "自行验证";
"Read the permissions" = "读取权限";
"Grep the source" = "grep 检索源代码";
"Watch the wire" = "监视网络流量";
