"~/Library/Application Support/Talkie — settings and history." = "~/Library/Application Support/Talkie——设置与历史记录。";
"~/Talkie Meetings — your recordings and transcripts, in plain folders you own." = "~/Talkie Meetings——你的录音和转写，存放在属于你的普通文件夹中。";
"Run these against the app on your own Mac. They read the live signature, grep the source, and watch the wire — the same checks the diagnostic report gathers for you." = "在你自己的 Mac 上针对该应用运行这些命令。它们会读取实时签名、检索源代码并监视网络流量——与诊断报告为你收集的检查完全相同。";

