"%@ ships a tiny local server so Claude can read your meetings, brief, commitments, context, stats, dictionary, and notes — on-device, nothing leaves your Mac. Claude can also manage your dictionary — adding, changing, or removing terms and rules — but every change waits for your one-tap confirmation with an Undo. Bundled with the app: no separate download or build." = "%@ 附带一个小型本地服务器，让 Claude 可以读取你的会议、简报、承诺、上下文、统计、词典和笔记——全部在设备上处理，不会离开你的 Mac。Claude 还可以管理你的词典——添加、更改或删除条目和规则——但每项更改都会等待你一键确认（可撤销）后才生效。随应用打包：无需单独下载或构建。";
"Detect meetings & offer to record" = "检测会议并提议录制";
